{% comment %}
  Hub featured card, product variant.

  Mirrors longeva-hub-featured-card but reads from a product instead of a
  page, so product-modelled bookable services (deposit-model vaccines and
  ailments such as Dengue and Adrenaline) sit alongside the page cards in a
  category hub with the same title / lede / price / duration rhythm.

  Accepts:
    product  Product object.
    attrs    Optional Shopify block attributes string.

  Price shown is the full treatment price (the product price is the 25%
  booking deposit, so it is multiplied by 4 to match the product hero) and
  uses the same "From <price>" wording as the page cards. The deposit detail
  lives on the product page.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  # Consultation/service-led display name: prefer a linked service_ref
  # metaobject's name (same convention as blocks/longeva-service-hero.liquid)
  # over the raw Shopify product title, so ailment products like the
  # anaphylaxis rescue treatment don't surface as bare retail medicine
  # wording on this card. Falls back to the title-stripping behaviour
  # below when no service_ref is linked.
  assign service = product.metafields.custom.service_ref.value
  if service and service.name != blank
    assign display_name = service.name
  else
    assign display_name = product.title | remove: ' Vaccination' | remove: ' vaccination'
  endif
  assign lede = product.metafields.custom.lede | default: ''
  if lede == blank
    assign lede = product.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 130
  endif
  assign has_real_price = false
  if product.price > 0
    assign has_real_price = true
    assign full_price = product.price | times: 4 | money
  endif
  comment
    Duration parity with the page cards. Falls back to 15 minutes (the
    standard consultation slot) when the product carries no duration_minutes,
    so every card in the merged list shows a title / price / duration triad.
  endcomment
  assign duration = product.metafields.custom.duration_minutes | default: ''
  if duration == blank
    assign duration = 15
  endif
-%}

<li class="longeva-hub__featured-card" data-longeva-reveal {{ attrs }}>
  <a class="longeva-hub__featured-link" href="{{ product.url }}">
    <h3 class="longeva-display longeva-hub__featured-title">{{ display_name | escape }}</h3>
    {% if lede != blank %}
      <p class="longeva-hub__featured-lede">{{ lede | escape }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="longeva-hub__featured-meta">
      {%- if has_real_price -%}
        <span class="longeva-hub__featured-price">From {{ full_price }}</span>
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="longeva-hub__featured-price longeva-hub__featured-price--placeholder">Assessed at consultation</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="longeva-hub__featured-dot" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span class="longeva-hub__featured-duration">{{ duration }} min</span>
    </p>
    <span class="longeva-hub__featured-arrow">{% render 'longeva-arrow', size: 22 %}</span>
  </a>
</li>
